      Pisces:      `Pisces governing your 3rd house places Jupiter as lord of Parakrama in its most spiritually oriented manifestation — your courage is devotional, your communication mystical, and your initiatives guided more by inner vision than rational calculation. You are drawn to creative, spiritual, or healing forms of expression. Siblings or close companions may have a spiritually significant relationship with you across lifetimes. Short journeys often carry pilgrimage-like qualities, connecting you to sacred places, artistic experiences, or transcendent encounters.`,
