      Sagittarius: `Sagittarius in your 11th house gives Jupiter as lord of your Labha Bhava — one of the most naturally auspicious placements for income, as Jupiter, the planet of abundance, lords the house of gains. Income flows through education, law, publishing, international connections, and spiritual or philosophical enterprises. Your social network includes teachers, philosophers, international contacts, and individuals of wisdom and institutional influence. Your desired goals are expansive, visionary, and oriented toward both material abundance and spiritual achievement. Gains arrive in generous measure when you align your aspirations with dharmic purpose.`,
